    "scenesThatPass": [
      "GLADYS: Mother has a surprise for you. Waiting up ahead.\nNORMA JEANE: A s-surprise?\nGLADYS: A birthday surprise.\nNORMA JEANE: Oh, mother! Where are we going?",
      "GLADYS: Don’t look at me like that!\nGLADYS: Don’t squint as if I’m going to crash this car in the next instant, you’ll make yourself need glasses and that’s the end for you! Stop squir…\nNORMA JEANE: Oh, Mother, what if the house burns down? I forgot my Tiger.\nGLADYS: That Toy! You’d be fortunate if it did burn. It’s a morbid attachment.",
      "MISS FLYNN: Why don’t you leave that Norma Jeane?\nNORMA JEANE: This is my Tiger. My mother gave to me.",
      "NORMA JEANE: Oh, Mother!\nGLADYS: Your hair is so white. Are you old like me?\nNORMA JEANE: Everyone was so worried about you, Mother. You won’t ever run away again, will you?\nGLADYS: I knew where I was going.",
      "HIS NIECE: Hey Marilyn, what’s it like being a movie star?\nNORMA JEANE: Oh, I’m not a s-star. I’m j-just some blonde.\nHIS NIECE: Oh, yeah. So the hair’s real?\nNORMA JEANE: People make pasta? I mean - not just in a store?"
    ]
